msgid "# Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B"
msgstr "# Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B is a large-scale MoE model with 2400 billion total\n"
"parameters and 95 billion activated parameters. It is built on the Qwen3.5\n"
"architecture and improves coding, professional work, scientific research, and\n"
"long-horizon agent tasks."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B 是一个大规模 MoE 模型，总参数量为 24000 亿，激活参数量为 950 亿。它基于 Qwen3.5 "
"架构构建，在编程、专业工作、科学研究和长周期智能体任务方面均有提升。"

msgid ""
"This document is validated and written based on **vLLM-Ascend 0.23.0**. The\n"
"current model (Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B) is first supported in this version."
msgstr ""
"本文档基于 **vLLM-Ascend 0.23.0** 进行验证和编写。当前模型（Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B）在该版本中首次获得支持。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持特性"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件"

msgid "### 3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "### 3.1 模型权重"

msgid "The following model weights are available:"
msgstr "以下模型权重可用："

msgid ""
"The checkpoint and tokenizer directories must be available at the same paths\n"
"on all serving nodes. The W8A8 deployment uses the lazy Safetensors strategy to\n"
"avoid prefetching the complete checkpoint from shared storage."
msgstr ""
"检查点和分词器目录必须在所有服务节点上以相同路径可用。W8A8 部署使用惰性 Safetensors 策略，以避免从共享存储预取完整检查点。"

msgid ""
"It is recommended to download the model weight to the shared directory of\n"
"multiple nodes, such as `/root/.cache/`."
msgstr "建议将模型权重下载到多节点的共享目录中，例如 `/root/.cache/`。"

msgid "### 3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication (Optional)"
msgstr "### 3.2 验证多节点通信（可选）"

msgid "## 4 Installation"
msgstr "## 4 安装"

msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation"
msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装"

msgid ""
"After entering the container, verify that vLLM and vLLM-Ascend can be "
"imported:"
msgstr "进入容器后，验证 vLLM 和 vLLM-Ascend 是否可以导入："

msgid "### 4.2 Source Code Installation"
msgstr "### 4.2 源码安装"

msgid ""
"If you want to deploy a multi-node service, install the same version of vLLM\n"
"and vLLM-Ascend on each node."
msgstr "如果要部署多节点服务，请在每个节点上安装相同版本的 vLLM 和 vLLM-Ascend。"

msgid "Before starting the service:"
msgstr "启动服务之前："

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, node count, parallel sizes, local IP address, network\n"
"  interface, service port, and RPC port with values from the target\n"
"  environment.\n"
"- `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"- Start Node 0 first. `NODE0_IP` on every worker must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node\n"
"  0.\n"
"- Assign every worker a unique `DP_START_RANK`."
msgstr ""
"- 将模型路径、节点数、并行大小、本地 IP 地址、网络接口、服务端口和 RPC 端口替换为目标环境中的值。\n"
"- `NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的接口。\n"
"- 先启动 Node 0。每个 worker 上的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于 Node 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"- 为每个 worker 分配唯一的 `DP_START_RANK`。"

msgid "The following values differ between the master and worker nodes:"
msgstr "主节点和 worker 节点之间的以下值有所不同："

msgid "| Setting | Node 0 | Nodes 1-3 | Description |"
msgstr "| 设置项 | Node 0 | Nodes 1-3 | 描述 |"

msgid "Key deployment parameters:"
msgstr "关键部署参数："

msgid "| Parameter | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"PD disaggregation separates Prefill and Decode into different service groups.\n"
"Prefill nodes process prompt chunks, Decode nodes serve token generation, and\n"
"a proxy forwards requests between them."
msgstr ""
"PD分离部署将Prefill和Decode划分为不同的服务组。\n"
"Prefill节点处理提示词块，Decode节点负责token生成，\n"
"代理在两者之间转发请求。"

msgid "## 6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证"

msgid ""
"After all DP ranks are ready, send a text request to the Node 0 API endpoint.\n"
"The open-weight model always uses thinking mode and does not support\n"
"multimodal input."
msgstr ""
"在所有DP rank就绪后，向Node 0 API端点发送文本请求。\n"
"开放权重模型始终使用思考模式，不支持\n"
"多模态输入。"

msgid "The model officially supports these reasoning effort levels:"
msgstr "该模型官方支持以下推理力度级别："

msgid ""
"- `xhigh`: default; deeper reasoning for complex tasks.\n"
"- `medium`: balances accuracy and speed.\n"
"- `low`: prioritizes speed and cost."
msgstr ""
"- `xhigh`：默认；针对复杂任务进行更深层次的推理。\n"
"- `medium`：在准确性和速度之间取得平衡。\n"
"- `low`：优先考虑速度和成本。"

msgid "## 7 Accuracy Evaluation"
msgstr "## 7 精度评估"

msgid "### 7.1 Prepare the Evaluation Environment"
msgstr "### 7.1 准备评估环境"

msgid "## 8 Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "## 8 性能评估"

msgid "### 8.1 Install AISBench"
msgstr "### 8.1 安装AISBench"

msgid ""
"Run AISBench in a separate environment or container so that the load generator\n"
"does not affect the serving processes. Refer to\n"
"[Using AISBench for performance evaluation](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-performance-evaluation)."
msgstr ""
"在独立的环境或容器中运行AISBench，以便负载生成器\n"
"不影响服务进程。请参阅\n"
"[使用AISBench进行性能评估](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-performance-evaluation)。"

msgid "### 8.2 Performance Service Configuration"
msgstr "### 8.2 性能服务配置"

msgid ""
"Use the deployment in Section 5 as the baseline. Change the following values\n"
"on all four nodes:"
msgstr "以第5节中的部署为基线。在所有四个节点上更改以下值："

msgid "| Parameter | Standard deployment | Performance test |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 标准部署 | 性能测试 |"

msgid "### 8.3 Run the Tests"
msgstr "### 8.3 运行测试"

msgid ""
"Run performance evaluation of `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B` as an example. Refer to\n"
"[vLLM benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for more details."
msgstr ""
"以`Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B`为例运行性能评估。有关更多详细信息，请参阅\n"
"[vLLM基准测试](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"

msgid ""
"Record the A3 node count, TP/PP/EP topology, context length, concurrency,\n"
"reasoning effort, and weight revision together with the result."
msgstr ""
"记录A3节点数量、TP/PP/EP拓扑、上下文长度、并发数、\n"
"推理力度和权重版本，并与结果一起保存。"

