msgid "### 5.1 Multi-Node Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 多节点部署"

msgid ""
"The validated mixed deployment runs one DP rank per node, uses tensor\n"
"parallelism within each node, and spans expert parallelism across all nodes.\n"
"Select the tab that matches your platform:"
msgstr "已验证的混合部署在每个节点上运行一个DP rank，在节点内使用张量并行，并在所有节点间使用专家并行。选择与您的平台匹配的标签页："

msgid ""
"- **A3 series**: four Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) nodes, DP4/TP16/EP64, with the\n"
"  W8A8 checkpoint.\n"
"- **A2 series**: eight Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) nodes, DP8/TP8/EP64, with the\n"
"  W4A8 checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"- **A3系列**：四个Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16)节点，DP4/TP16/EP64，使用W8A8检查点。\n"
"- **A2系列**：八个Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8)节点，DP8/TP8/EP64，使用W4A8检查点。"

msgid "=== \"Node 0\""
msgstr "=== \"节点0\""

msgid "=== \"Nodes 1-3\""
msgstr "=== \"节点1-3\""

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the\n"
"        current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to `1`, `2`, or `3`."
msgstr ""
"在每个工作节点上运行此命令。将`LOCAL_IP`和`NIC_NAME`设置为当前节点，并将`DP_START_RANK`设置为`1`、`2`或`3`。"

msgid ""
"    | `LOCAL_IP` | Node 0 IP | Current worker IP | Each node uses its own "
"communication IP. |"
msgstr "    | `LOCAL_IP` | 节点0 IP | 当前工作节点IP | 每个节点使用自己的通信IP。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `NODE0_IP` | Not required | Node 0 IP | Workers use this address to "
"join the DP group. |"
msgstr "    | `NODE0_IP` | 不需要 | 节点0 IP | 工作节点使用此地址加入DP组。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--headless` | Omitted | Enabled | Workers do not expose an API "
"endpoint. |"
msgstr "    | `--headless` | 省略 | 启用 | 工作节点不暴露API端点。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address` | `$LOCAL_IP` | `$NODE0_IP` | Always "
"resolves to Node 0. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-address` | `$LOCAL_IP` | `$NODE0_IP` | 始终解析为节点0。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | `0` by default | `1`, `2`, or `3` | "
"Every node must own a unique DP rank. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | 默认为`0` | `1`、`2`或`3` | 每个节点必须拥有唯一的DP "
"rank。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 16` | Uses all 16 NPUs in one A3 node for "
"tensor parallelism. |"
msgstr "    | `--tensor-parallel-size 16` | 使用一个A3节点中的所有16个NPU进行张量并行。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size 4` | Creates four global DP ranks across four "
"nodes. |"
msgstr "    | `--data-parallel-size 4` | 在四个节点间创建四个全局DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | Runs one DP rank on the current node."
" |"
msgstr "    | `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | 在当前节点上运行一个DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | Selects the global DP rank of a worker "
"node. |"
msgstr "    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | 选择工作节点的全局DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--enable-expert-parallel` | Enables expert parallelism for the MoE "
"layers. |"
msgstr "    | `--enable-expert-parallel` | 为MoE层启用专家并行。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-model-len 131072` | Sets the maximum combined input and output "
"length. |"
msgstr "    | `--max-model-len 131072` | 设置输入和输出的最大组合长度。 |"

msgid "    | `--quantization ascend` | Enables Ascend W8A8 quantization. |"
msgstr "    | `--quantization ascend` | 启用Ascend W8A8量化。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | Avoids prefetching the complete "
"2.33 TiB checkpoint from NFS. |"
msgstr "    | `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | 避免从NFS预取完整的2.33 TiB检查点。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-num-seqs 8` | Sets eight active sequences for each DP group and"
" 32 across DP4. |"
msgstr "    | `--max-num-seqs 8` | 为每个DP组设置八个活动序列，跨DP4共32个。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` | Controls the scheduler token "
"budget. |"
msgstr "    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` | 控制调度器的token预算。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.85` | Reserves HBM headroom for runtime "
"memory. |"
msgstr "    | `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.85` | 为运行时内存保留HBM余量。 |"

msgid "    | `--enable-prefix-caching` | Enables automatic prefix caching. |"
msgstr "    | `--enable-prefix-caching` | 启用自动前缀缓存。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--speculative-config` | Enables one Qwen3.5 MTP speculative token. |"
msgstr "    | `--speculative-config` | 启用一个Qwen3.5 MTP推测token。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--compilation-config` | Uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph replay. |"
msgstr "    | `--compilation-config` | 使用`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph重放。 |"

msgid "    | `--additional-config` | Enables CPU binding and Fused MC2. |"
msgstr "    | `--additional-config` | 启用CPU绑定和Fused MC2。 |"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If a worker exits immediately, confirm that Node 0 is\n"
"    already running, `--data-parallel-address` resolves to Node 0, all nodes\n"
"    use the same RPC port, and every worker uses a unique DP start rank."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果工作节点立即退出，请确认节点0已在运行，`--data-parallel-"
"address`解析为节点0，所有节点使用相同的RPC端口，并且每个工作节点使用唯一的DP起始rank。"

msgid ""
"The validated mixed deployment uses eight Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) nodes\n"
"    with the `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w4a8` checkpoint. Data parallelism spans the\n"
"    eight nodes, each node runs one DP rank, tensor parallelism uses all 8\n"
"    NPUs in the node, and the resulting topology is DP8/TP8/EP64."
msgstr ""
"已验证的混合部署使用八个Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × "
"8)节点，使用`Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w4a8`检查点。数据并行跨越八个节点，每个节点运行一个DP "
"rank，张量并行使用节点内的所有8个NPU，最终拓扑为DP8/TP8/EP64。"

msgid ""
"The W4A8 checkpoint is used on A2 so that enough HBM remains for the\n"
"    large activation footprint of the 95B activated parameters. Because the\n"
"    per-token MoE intermediate buffers are large, `--max-num-batched-tokens`\n"
"    is reduced to 4096 and `--gpu-memory-utilization` is raised to 0.92\n"
"    compared with the A3 configuration. The smaller token budget keeps the\n"
"    MoE activation peak low enough to leave KV cache room for a 262144\n"
"    context length."
msgstr ""
"在A2上使用W4A8检查点，以便为95B激活参数的大型激活占用保留足够的HBM。由于每个token的MoE中间缓冲区较大，与A3配置相比，`--max-"
"num-batched-tokens`减少到4096，`--gpu-memory-"
"utilization`提高到0.92。较小的token预算使MoE激活峰值保持足够低，从而为262144上下文长度留出KV缓存空间。"

msgid "=== \"Nodes 1-7\""
msgstr "=== \"节点1-7\""

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the\n"
"        current node and set `DP_START_RANK` to a unique value from `1` to\n"
"        `7`."
msgstr ""
"在每个工作节点上运行此命令。将 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为\n"
"        当前节点，并将 `DP_START_RANK` 设置为从 `1` 到 `7` 的唯一值。"

msgid "| Setting | Node 0 | Nodes 1-7 | Description |"
msgstr "| 设置 | 节点 0 | 节点 1-7 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | `0` by default | `1` to `7` | Every "
"node must own a unique DP rank. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--data-parallel-start-rank` | 默认为 `0` | `1` 到 `7` | 每个节点必须拥有唯一的 DP "
"排名。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8` | Uses all 8 NPUs in one A2 node for tensor"
" parallelism. |"
msgstr "    | `--tensor-parallel-size 8` | 使用一个 A2 节点中的所有 8 个 NPU 进行张量并行。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--data-parallel-size 8` | Creates eight global DP ranks across eight "
"nodes. |"
msgstr "    | `--data-parallel-size 8` | 在八个节点之间创建八个全局 DP 排名。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-model-len 262144` | Sets the maximum combined input and output "
"length. |"
msgstr "    | `--max-model-len 262144` | 设置输入和输出的最大组合长度。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--quantization ascend` | Enables Ascend W4A8 quantization for the "
"validated checkpoint. |"
msgstr "    | `--quantization ascend` | 为已验证的检查点启用 Ascend W4A8 量化。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | Avoids prefetching the complete "
"checkpoint from NFS. |"
msgstr "    | `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | 避免从 NFS 预取完整的检查点。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-num-seqs 8` | Sets eight active sequences for each DP group. |"
msgstr "    | `--max-num-seqs 8` | 为每个 DP 组设置八个活动序列。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 4096` | Controls the scheduler token budget."
" Larger values increase the MoE activation peak and shrink the KV cache "
"available for the 262144 context. |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--max-num-batched-tokens 4096` | 控制调度器的 token 预算。较大的值会增加 MoE "
"激活峰值，并减少可用于 262144 上下文的 KV 缓存。 |"

msgid ""
"    | `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.92` | Reserves HBM headroom for the "
"weights and activation peak on 64GB nodes. |"
msgstr ""
