msgid "### 9.2 Tuning Guidelines"
msgstr "### 9.2 调优指南"

msgid "#### 9.2.1 General Tuning Reference"
msgstr "#### 9.2.1 通用调优参考"

msgid ""
"Refer to\n"
"[Public Performance Tuning Documentation](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)\n"
"for general tuning methods, and refer to the\n"
"[Feature Matrix](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md) for feature\n"
"descriptions."
msgstr ""
"有关通用调优方法，请参阅\n"
"[公开性能调优文档](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)，\n"
"有关功能描述，请参阅\n"
"[功能矩阵](../../user_guide/support_matrix/feature_matrix.md)。"

msgid "Recommended tuning order:"
msgstr "推荐的调优顺序："

msgid ""
"1. Set the deployment topology first. The validated configuration uses four\n"
"   A3 nodes with DP4/TP16/EP64.\n"
"2. Choose the maximum context length with `--max-model-len`. Long context\n"
"   increases KV cache usage, so reduce `--max-num-seqs` or\n"
"   `--gpu-memory-utilization` if OOM occurs.\n"
"3. Tune `--max-num-batched-tokens`. Larger values usually improve prefill\n"
"   throughput but increase activation memory. Decode-heavy workloads usually\n"
"   need smaller values.\n"
"4. Tune `--max-num-seqs` according to service concurrency. Requests above\n"
"   this value wait in the queue, and the waiting time is counted in TTFT and\n"
"   TPOT.\n"
"5. Tune `--gpu-memory-utilization`. Increase it to provide more KV cache, but\n"
"   leave headroom for runtime memory fluctuation and expert imbalance.\n"
"6. Tune `--speculative-config`. MTP can improve decode throughput, but the\n"
"   optimal `num_speculative_tokens` depends on acceptance rate and workload.\n"
"7. Tune ACL Graph capture. `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` is recommended for decode. If\n"
"   `cudagraph_capture_sizes` is set manually, include common decode batch\n"
"   sizes."
msgstr ""
"1. 首先设置部署拓扑。已验证的配置使用四个 A3 节点，采用 DP4/TP16/EP64。\n"
"2. 使用 `--max-model-len` 选择最大上下文长度。长上下文会增加 KV 缓存\n"
"   使用量，因此如果发生 OOM，请减少 `--max-num-seqs` 或\n"
"   `--gpu-memory-utilization`。\n"
"3. 调整 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。较大的值通常可以提高预填充吞吐量，\n"
"   但会增加激活内存。解码密集型工作负载通常需要较小的值。\n"
"4. 根据服务并发度调整 `--max-num-seqs`。超过此值的请求将在队列中等待，\n"
"   等待时间计入 TTFT 和 TPOT。\n"
"5. 调整 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。增大该值可提供更多 KV 缓存，但需要为\n"
"   运行时内存波动和专家不均衡预留余量。\n"
"6. 调整 `--speculative-config`。MTP 可以提高解码吞吐量，但最佳的\n"
"   `num_speculative_tokens` 取决于接受率和工作负载。\n"
"7. 调整 ACL Graph 捕获。解码推荐使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY`。如果手动设置\n"
"   `cudagraph_capture_sizes`，请包含常见的解码批处理大小。"

msgid "#### 9.2.2 Model-Specific Optimizations"
msgstr "#### 9.2.2 模型特定优化"

msgid "| Optimization | Enablement | Benefit | Notes |"
msgstr "| 优化 | 启用方式 | 收益 | 备注 |"

msgid ""
"| Chunked Prefill | Enabled by the vLLM V1 scheduler | Splits long prefill "
"inputs to reduce per-step memory peaks. | Tune with `--max-num-batched-"
"tokens`. |"
msgstr ""
"| 分块预填充 | 由 vLLM V1 调度器启用 | 拆分长预填充输入以减少每步内存峰值。 | 使用 `--max-num-batched-"
"tokens` 调整。 |"

msgid ""
"| Prefix Cache | `--enable-prefix-caching` | Reuses KV state for repeated "
"prefixes. | The benefit depends on the prefix cache hit rate. |"
msgstr "| 前缀缓存 | `--enable-prefix-caching` | 为重复前缀重用 KV 状态。 | 收益取决于前缀缓存命中率。 |"

msgid ""
"| Qwen3.5 MTP speculative decoding | `--speculative-config "
"'{\"method\":\"qwen3_5_mtp\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":1}'` | Improves "
"decode throughput when the acceptance rate is good. | Tune the speculative "
"token count for the target workload. |"
msgstr ""
"| Qwen3.5 MTP 投机解码 | `--speculative-config "
"'{\"method\":\"qwen3_5_mtp\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":1}'` | "
"在接受率良好时提高解码吞吐量。 | 根据目标工作负载调整投机 token 数量。 |"

msgid ""
"| Full decode ACL Graph | `--compilation-config "
"'{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` | Reduces operator dispatch "
"overhead during decode. | Used by the validated configuration. |"
msgstr ""
"| 全解码ACL图 | `--compilation-config "
"'{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` | 减少解码过程中的算子调度开销。 | 由已验证配置使用。 |"

msgid ""
"| Fused MC2 | `--additional-config '{\"enable_fused_mc2\":1}'` | Enables "
"fused MoE communication and computation. | Used by the validated "
"configuration. |"
msgstr ""
"| 融合MC2 | `--additional-config '{\"enable_fused_mc2\":1}'` | 启用融合的MoE通信与计算。 "
"| 由已验证配置使用。 |"

msgid ""
"| Lazy Safetensors | `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | Avoids prefetching"
" the complete checkpoint from shared storage. | Used for the W8A8 "
"checkpoint. |"
msgstr ""
"| 惰性Safetensors | `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | 避免从共享存储预取完整检查点。 | "
"用于W8A8检查点。 |"

msgid ""
"| CPU binding | `--additional-config '{\"enable_cpu_binding\":true}'` | "
"Reduces CPU scheduling jitter. | Explicitly enabled in the deployment "
"commands. |"
msgstr ""
"| CPU绑定 | `--additional-config '{\"enable_cpu_binding\":true}'` | 减少CPU调度抖动。"
" | 在部署命令中显式启用。 |"

